version: 2.0.0
description: Repo-level maintenance scripts (not shipped).
components:
  migrate-tool-names:
    description: 'v7.13.0 (T-2026-09-26-005) reference codemod for the MCP surface cut. Parses LEGACY_TOOL_MAP out of packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/legacy-tool-map.ts (#legacy-tool-map, never duplicated) and rewrites renamed legacy names in agent-facing surfaces (TARGETS; EXCLUDE = CHANGELOG, lore/history/events/reviews, docs/private+specs, *.test.*, seed-habits.json). Forms: call `x_op({` → `x({op:''op'', `; wrapped `` `x_op` `` → `` `x` (op `op`) ``; bare → `x (op `op`)` (md) / `x (op: op)` (code/shell); `mcp__…__x_op` and allowed-tools/tools lines → family name (deduped). Idempotent. Dry run by default; `--write` applies. Guarded by packages/paradigm/src/__tests__/legacy-tool-names.test.ts.'
    type: utility
    file: migrate-tool-names.mjs
    tags:
      - codemod
      - mcp-surface
      - v7.13.0
  release-publish:
    description: '`npm run release` (CI release.yml via changesets/action). Preflight first: @a-company/gnomon-darwin-arm64, -x64 and @a-company/gnomon must already be on npm at the checkout''s version (npm view; registry errors fail closed), else it refuses before building or publishing and names `npm run publish:gnomon`. Then `changeset publish`, which skips them as already published, so CI never publishes gnomon and paradigm (exact @a-company/gnomon dependency) never ships before it. `--check` runs the preflight only. Node >= 20, node: built-ins only. Guarded by packages/gnomon/test/release-excludes-gnomon.test.ts.'
    type: utility
    file: release.mjs
    tags:
      - release
      - gnomon
  publish-gnomon:
    description: '`npm run publish:gnomon`, the founder''s Mac-only publish in install order: gate-gnomon-publish.mjs, then @a-company/gnomon-darwin-arm64, -x64, then @a-company/gnomon (each skipped if already on npm, so re-runnable), then verifies all three are visible on npm; `--release` then runs `npm run release` for paradigm; `--dry-run` runs the gate and prints the rest. Guarded by packages/gnomon/test/release-excludes-gnomon.test.ts.'
    type: utility
    file: publish-gnomon.mjs
    tags:
      - release
      - gnomon
  pre-publish-check:
    description: Pre-publish sanity checks run before npm publish.
    type: utility
    file: pre-publish-check.mjs
